<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-019" chapter-id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan" source-id="s-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan-ws1531762">
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">純</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">景懋</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005" ref="684_eaa_511">景仁</persName>弟也。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0010" ref="a59_2c3_a2e">劉毅</persName>鎮江陵，以爲衛軍長史、南平相。及<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0028" ref="quq_d6y_akf">王鎮惡</persName>襲<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0032" ref="a59_2c3_a2e">毅</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0034" ref="a59_2c3_a2e">毅</persName>時病，<rs id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0038" type="unresolved">佐史</rs>聞兵至，馳還入府，<rs id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0049" type="unresolved">左右</rs>引車欲還外廨，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0058" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">純</persName>叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲安之。」及入，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0078" ref="a59_2c3_a2e">毅</persName>兵敗<rs id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0081" type="unresolved">眾</rs>散，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0084" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">純</persName>爲<rs id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0086" type="unresolved">人</rs>所殺。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">純</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABB">甝</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p002:m0004" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABB">景甝</persName>，位司徒右長史。</p>
</text>
